WEBVTT

00:04:59.045 --> 00:05:00.046
(Laughter)

00:05:00.046 --> 00:05:01.088
and “Pokémon”

00:05:01.088 --> 00:05:02.214
and many others.

00:05:03.257 --> 00:05:07.219
You probably have
a teenage relative or neighbor

00:05:07.219 --> 00:05:08.888
who reads or writes fanfiction.

00:05:12.016 --> 00:05:15.227
These stories are wildly diverse

00:05:15.227 --> 00:05:19.565
and may be creative,
thoughtful or hilarious.

00:05:20.358 --> 00:05:22.943
You might find titles like,

00:05:22.943 --> 00:05:25.654
“When Harry Potter
Accidentally Started a Cult.”

00:05:26.072 --> 00:05:27.073
(Laughter)

00:05:28.491 --> 00:05:32.787
Or, “Five Times Hermione Snogged Harry --